The "#session" command will allow you to start a session.  When you're
done, "#end" will close Lyntin.

Type "#help help" for help on how to use the in-game help system.
Type "#help <command>" for help on commands.  These topics will be of
great interest to you:

   action               alias
   end                  gag
   highlight            session
   read                 write

Read through the "#help manual" topics--these will help as well.

Also, each user interface has its own help topic:

   tkui                 textui

category: readme
